    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d109-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d109-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Conference Files: Lot 66 D 347, CF 85. Secret;
                    Exdis. Drafted by Niles and approved in S on
                    October 27. The source text is labeled “Part I of II;” a separate memorandum of
                    the portion of the conversation dealing with trade is ibid.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d109-f2" n="2" xml:id="d109-f2-content">
                <p>O’Shaughnessy died of a heart attack on September 24 in Budapest.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
